00:32:16,821 --> 00:32:21,820
see.

611
00:32:21,920 --> 00:32:24,820
Tank fried tortilla chips.

612
00:32:24,920 --> 00:32:28,260
Anita's Mexican Foods in San Bernardino, California,

613
00:32:28,360 --> 00:32:31,600
bakes and fries organic tortilla chips and taco shells

614
00:32:31,700 --> 00:32:36,540
